Package: adsdata
Title: Data and Helpers for the Advanced Data Science Module
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Michael", "Buecker", , "michael.buecker@fh-muenster.de", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0045-8460"))
Description: Provides the data sets and helper functions used in the
    Advanced Data Science module at the Muenster School of Business. The
    data are simulated from a documented generating process, so analyses
    can be checked against a known truth.
